  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\n- **Home button.** The top band has a **Home** button, left of **Donate**. The glyph is the Tabler `home` outline (MIT). A click shows the start page. A second click hides it.\r\n- **Start page.** The page stands in for the dock in the central area. The ribbon and the status strip stay. The page shows:\r\n  - **Recent projects**: the #662 list from the user settings file, newest first. A file that is not there any more is greyed, reads \"(missing)\" and takes no click. Its hover gives the refusal text.\r\n  - Each row shows the path in a faint ink. The page removes the Windows verbatim prefix (`\\?\\`) from the path that it shows (`home::shown_path`).\r\n  - **Open project…**, **New project** and **Back to the project**, through the form seam's `action_bar`.\r\n- **Open.** A click on a project queues `OpenRecent`, the same command as the ribbon's Open list. The unsaved-changes prompt and the refusals are Open's own.\r\n- **Close.** The page keeps the `doc_version` that it opened over (`State::home_page`). It closes when the document changes: an open, New, an import or a command. A refused open or a cancelled prompt does not change the document, so the page stays.\r\n- **Start.** The native window shows the page when the command line names no file (`home::at_start`). A fresh `State` has no page, so the harnesses, the snapshots and the browser build start as before.\r\n- **Version.** The version label was already the rightmost toolbar item (#556). It stays there. A test pins it at the right of the top bar.\r\n- **No command, no MCP tool.** The page and the button are view state. The open uses the existing `OpenRecent` command.\r\n- **Site icons.** `site/static/icons/` takes `home.png` and the current `LICENSES.txt`. It also takes `act-report.png`: #1696 added that icon to the app but not to the site, so `test_guide_icons` was red on main.\r\n- **Guide.** `getting-started/first-run.md` has a \"The start page\" section.\r\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/2384-home-start-page.md`.\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\nHeadless render, dark theme, the seeded document, three recent projects (one missing).\r\n\r\nTop bar, before (`main`):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"642\" height=\"135\" alt=\"top_bar\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e314771f-b6cc-43cd-9b67-3b37bae4b4c6\" />\r\n\r\nTop bar, after (this PR): \r\n\r\n<img width=\"642\" height=\"135\" alt=\"top_bar\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9068f70c-8e3d-4a56-8ec8-043e44890734\" />\r\n\r\nStart page (this PR):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"start_page\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10df909a-c1e4-451d-99f1-7b8e833b843e\" />\r\n\r\n## Pinning tests\r\n\r\n- `egui_app::tests::home_page` (8 tests):\r\n  - `the_home_button_is_in_the_top_band_left_of_donate`: the button, its place left of Donate, and the version painted at the right.\r\n  - `home_shows_the_recent_projects_in_place_of_the_dock_and_back_returns`: the rows newest first, the missing row disabled, the Properties pane hidden while the page is up, Back and a second Home press.\r\n  - `a_project_click_opens_it_through_open_and_closes_the_page`\r\n  - `a_cancelled_unsaved_prompt_keeps_the_page_and_the_document`\r\n  - `an_empty_list_says_so_and_new_project_closes_the_page`\r\n  - `the_page_shows_at_a_start_with_no_file_only`: no file opens the page; a named file does not; still frames keep it up.\r\n  - `the_page_shows_a_stored_path_without_the_verbatim_prefix`\r\n- `egui_app::tests::page_layout::layout_page_home`: the heading, the list and the actions stack top to bottom, below the top band.\r\n\r\n## Readings\r\n\r\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` on 046cb05e2: 17 steps, all ok (`ui suites: lib` included).\r\n- After the merge of main (a821587da; conflict only in `site/static/icons/LICENSES.txt`, now the copy of the merged `assets/ui/LICENSES.md`): quick gate 17 steps ok; `home_page` and `layout_page_home` 8 passed; clippy clean; the site icon check passes.\r\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\r\n- `cargo xtask icons --check`: 0 breaches.\r\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main --dry-run`: the diff reaches no heavy lane.\r\n- `site/tests/test_guide_icons.py`: the two icon checks pass (`PYTHONUTF8=1`).\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\n- `test_zola_build_renders_all_icons_and_notice_under_prefix`: `zola` is not installed here. Not run.\r\n- No windowed run. The screenshots are headless. The start at a real launch with no file (`home::at_start` in `shell_window.rs`) is pinned only through the function, not through a real process start.\r\n- No run on Linux or macOS.\r\n\r\nChangelog: A Home button in the top bar shows a start page with the recent projects; the page opens at a start with no file (#2384)\r\n\r\nFixes #2384\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\r\n\r\n",
